Subject: Derived CPMS I03A Host Admission Evidence Protocol Source
Description: Source-preserved manager articulation for obtaining complete, immediate, non-bypass Windows application-control and process-result evidence around a future authorized I03A Revision 1 activation attempt. It responds to circular Code Integrity log rollover and does not authorize a retry, dependency mutation, compilation, signing, policy change, or execution.

